# Leave migrations unapplied

Write or edit the migration file when the schema needs to change. Stop there.

The human applies it. Do not run migrate, upgrade, rollback, seed-against-schema,
or any other command that applies or reverts schema on a database — including
local, Docker, and "just to test".

```
# Do
rails generate migration AddIndexToUsers
# then stop

# Don't
rails db:migrate
alembic upgrade head
prisma migrate deploy
python manage.py migrate
npm run db:migrate
```
